window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Fighting the fae council came with a few drawbacks Silas didn't expect.</b></p> <p>While he was able to secure the second shield shard, Rufian left him a parting gift that was both petty and precarious. With the clock to save Thalian winding down, Silas must assemble forces from the goblin, fae, and orc territories to secure the last shard nestled within the Dragon Conclave.</p> <p>He is going to need all the help he can get to save the crystal-core goddess from exploding and sending Thalian into an inevitable apocalypse.</p> <p>Follow Silas in this last installment of the series as he and his party shake the foundation of the dragon empire. HEA ending included!</p>"; 
